      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "telop" : "「ええ、そうよ。魔法使いに神社を丸ごと燃やされたからね。\nねぇ、魔理沙、そこにいるのでしょう？」",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.016.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #16",
      "id" : "43CA24B4-444A-4AED-B6DA-D83E932705FB",
      "duration" : 8.656984126984126,
      "title" : "シーン 16",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73543_【背景素材】守矢神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_016_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.056984126984126
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "telop" : "「まぁ、魔理沙には、あの小屋で全て言ったからいいわ。」",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.017.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #17",
      "id" : "6D44EABB-DB9C-4F73-B8D6-241530407569",
      "duration" : 4.541995464852608,
      "title" : "シーン 17",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73543_【背景素材】守矢神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.941995464852608,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "telop" : "私は、そこでふと思い出す。そして、守谷神社に入っていく。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.018.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #18",
      "id" : "06071B83-A88D-4663-877C-88BC741DAE10",
      "duration" : 5.909478458049886,
      "title" : "シーン 18",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73543_【背景素材】守矢神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.309478458049886,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "僕は、追っ手が来る前に、彼女の後について神社に入っていく。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.019.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #19",
      "id" : "44F64B76-E85A-4A2E-BD6D-E56606203B26",
      "duration" : 4.847369614512472,
      "title" : "シーン 19",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73543_【背景素材】守矢神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.247369614512472
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "そして僕は、こないだ来た時にも入った和室で休む。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.020.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #20",
      "id" : "F75CFBA4-6B9E-4DF7-9571-FABD2A5D5816",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 4.143038548752834,
      "title" : "シーン 20",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.5430385487528344
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "seAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/ふすまを開ける1.mp3",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "すると、誰かが襖を開けて入ってくる。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.021.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #21",
      "id" : "89EFA651-2220-4CC7-BE1E-D4D3B99BFE84",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 3.5,
      "title" : "シーン 21",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_021_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.6865079365079363,
      "seName" : "SE: ふすまを開ける1"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "「これ、何でかわからないけど、神社の燃え後に放置されてたのよ。」私はそういうと、その荷物を渡す。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.022.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #22",
      "id" : "2ADAF2D6-8FE1-45E6-B665-0593B9ACA6D3",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 7.7995464852607705,
      "title" : "シーン 22",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_022_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.199546485260771,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "僕は、その箱を開けて中身を取り出す。そして、それを取り出すと、中身を確認する。中身は空で、箱には弾が入っていた。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.023.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #23",
      "id" : "373457E0-7E48-41DD-A18F-508D9B0D4504",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 9.871292517006802,
      "title" : "シーン 23",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.271292517006803
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "「これ、何なの？」",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.024.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #24",
      "id" : "77F912E8-F50D-4B13-A8B8-D529756B502F",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 3.5,
      "title" : "シーン 24",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 1.5,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "「これは、弾を詰め込んで、引き金を引くことで、\nその弾を相手に当てるのが目的の道具ですよ。」",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.025.jpeg",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #25",
      "id" : "59446B2C-0806-472D-A402-529C0F0598D4",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "duration" : 6.997369614512471,
      "title" : "シーン 25",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc467347_和室【フリー素材あそび】.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_操夢.wav",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.397369614512471,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png"
    },
    {
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "telop" : "「へぇ、まぁ、とりあえず、中身の管理は任せたわ。」\n私はそういうと、その場を離れた。",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/第13話_d1addf853c\/第13話_d1addf853c.026.jpeg",
